[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-fg-offers-grants-loans-starter-packs-to-tvet-batch-a-graduates-in-nigeria-140":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},140,"fg-offers-grants-loans-starter-packs-to-tvet-batch-a-graduates-in-nigeria-140","Fg Offers Grants, Loans, Starter Packs To Tvet Batch A Graduates In Nigeria","\u003Cp>The TVET Program is part of the government’s ongoing effort to tackle unemployment, promote entrepreneurship, and equip young Nigerians with practical, income-generating skills.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>FG Support Package for TVET Batch A Graduates\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Under this initiative, eligible TVET graduates will receive a combination of financial assistance and practical tools to help them transition into the workforce or start their own businesses.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The support package includes:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Business grants\u003C\u002Fstrong> to kick-start entrepreneurial ventures\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Low-interest loans\u003C\u002Fstrong> to expand small businesses\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Starter packs\u003C\u002Fstrong> with essential tools and equipment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>The program ensures that beneficiaries are not left stranded after training but are fully equipped to become \u003Cstrong>self-employed and economically independent\u003C\u002Fstrong>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Strengthening Vocational Skills in Nigeria\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The TVET program focuses on \u003Cstrong>hands-on, practical training\u003C\u002Fstrong> in high-demand sectors, including:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Welding and fabrication\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Electrical installation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fashion design and tailoring\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>ICT and digital skills\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Carpentry and construction\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>FG’s Commitment to Youth Empowerment\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Officials have reiterated that the initiative is designed to empower young Nigerians by providing not just training but also the resources needed to succeed.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The program supports the government’s goals to:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Reduce youth unemployment in Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Promote small and medium-scale enterprises (SMEs)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Encourage self-reliance among graduates\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Boost economic productivity\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>What This Means for TVET Graduates\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>For beneficiaries, this initiative opens up multiple opportunities. With access to funding and tools, you can:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Scholarship news updates\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Start your own business immediately after training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Offer professional services within your community\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Build a steady income stream\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employ others and contribute to economic growth\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>The combination of skills training and financial support positions graduates for \u003Cstrong>long-term success\u003C\u002Fstrong>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Future Opportunities for TVET Applicants\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Federal Government has indicated that similar support will be extended to future batches of the TVET program. This means more Nigerians will have access to:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Free or subsidized vocational training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Business funding opportunities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career development support\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>If you are interested in skill acquisition and entrepreneurship, enrolling in upcoming TVET batches could be a \u003Cstrong>life-changing opportunity\u003C\u002Fstrong>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>TVET Batch B Application to Open April 13\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Federal Government has announced the commencement of applications for the second cohort of the National Technical and Vocational Education and Training (TVET) Programme, with the portal scheduled to open on April 13th, at 4:00 p.m. West Africa Time (WAT).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE:\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffederal-government-tvet-program-initiative\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffederal-government-tvet-program-initiative\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-14 15:45:39",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ffg-offers-grants-loans-starter-packs-to-tvet-batch-a-graduates-in-nigeria\u002F69de5313deb5c5.13966164_screenshot 2026-04-14 154153.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ffg-offers-grants-loans-starter-packs-to-tvet-batch-a-graduates-in-nigeria\u002F69de5313deb5c5.13966164_screenshot%202026-04-14%20154153.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id"